<title>USA: Clinton says balancing budget is first task.</title>
<headline>Clinton says balancing budget is first task.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton, making his first major policy speech since he won re-election, said on Wednesday his first task is to balance the federal budget.</p>
<p>&quot;Our first task is to finish the job of balancing the budget,&quot; Clinton said in a speech at the annual conference of the Democratic Leadership Council, a centrist group of politicians in the Democratic party.</p>
</text>
